  "description": "A one-finger rope-swinging game, open to everyone: real rope physics over lava through ten biomes with their own weather and soundtracks. Saws, drones, rockets, fire spouts, speed lasers and world-flipping rings; ten stackable power-ups; eleven modes including co-op, racing, time trial and the daily course; a ghost of your best run, and an online lobby where you can challenge anyone playing to a live head-to-head race.",
